  "content": "[Intro]\n[G#5]\n[C#]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[B]Happy little day,\nJimmy went away\nMet his little Jenny on a\n[F#]public holiday\n[B]A happy pair they made, so\ndecorously laid 'Neath the\ngay illuminations all a-\n[F#]long the promenade \"It's so\n[A]good to know there's still a little ma-\n[E]gic [E/D#]in the\n[C#m]air [G#]I'll\n[C#m]weave [B]my [E]spell\"\n[C#]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[B]\"Jenny will you stay,\ntarry with me pray Nothing 'ere\nneed come between us Tell me\n[F#]love, what do you say?\" \"Oh\n[B]no, I must away, to my\nMum in disarray If my\nmother should discover how I\n[F#]spent my holiday It would\n[A]be of small avail to talk of\n[E]magic [E/D#]in the\n[C#m]air [G#]I'll\n[C#m]say [B]fare-\n[E]well\"\n\n[Bridge]\n[C#m]O Rock [B]of [E]A-\nges, do not crum-\n[A]ble, love [A/G#]is [F#m7]brea-\n[B]thing [E]still\n[C#m]O Lady Moon,\n[F#]shine down a\n[B]little people ma-\ngic if you will\n\n[Break]\n[A]\n[E]\n[A]\n[E]\n[A]\n[G5]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[E5]\n[C5]\n[E5]\n\n[Break]\n[A]\n[E]\n[A]\n[E]\n[A]\n[G5]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[E5]\n[A5]\n[E5]\n[A5]\n[E5]\n\n[Solo 3]\n[E5]\n[D]\n[E5]\n\n[Bridge]\n[C#]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[B]Jenny pines away, writes a\nletter everyday We must\never be together, nothing can\n[F#]my love erase Oh\n[B]no I'm compromised, I\nmust apologize If my\nlady should discover how I\n[F#]spent my holidays\n[A]\n[B]\n\n[Outro]\n[Bsus4]\n[E5]\n[A5]  [G5]\n[E5]\n[A5]  [G5]\n[E5]\n[E7#9]",
